================================================================================
UNRESOLVED — INHERITED FROM UPSTREAM
================================================================================

These are not introduced by this fork, but they travel with it and are recorded
here honestly rather than left for a downstream user to discover:

  * app/src/main/jniLibs/*/libjni_latinimegoogle.so — four prebuilt native
    binaries with no source-provenance record. GPL-3.0 requires corresponding
    source for shipped binaries. They appear to be builds of the JNI sources in
    this same tree, but that is unverified. Either rebuild them from source or
    remove them; JniLibName.kt already falls back to jni_latinime.
  * tools/make-emoji-keys/src/main/kotlin/com/majeur/** — 18 Kotlin files with
    no copyright header or stated licence.
  * The application icon's licence is not stated, only its author credited.
  * dictionaries/ ships no licence text for the wordlists it contains.
  * tools/*/bin/** contains checked-in build output (97 files) that should not
    be in source control.

